{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': "EMERSON PROVIDES ADVANCED AUTOMATION TECHNOLOGY FOR TOYOTA AUSTRALIA'S HYDROGEN PRODUCTION AND REFUELING PLANT", 'text': "AUSTIN, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLOBAL SOFTWARE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) AND TOYOTA AUSTRALIA HAVE COLLABORATED TO TRANSFORM PART OF TOYOTA AUSTRALIA'S OPERATIONS INTO A COMMERCIAL-GRADE HYDROGEN PRODUCTION, STORAGE AND REFUELING PLANT. THE PROJECT, SUPPORTED BY THE AUSTRALIAN RENEWABLE ENERGY AGENCY (ARENA), ADOPTS EMERSON'S AUTOMATION EXPERTISE TO PROVIDE THE CONTROL SYSTEM THAT HELPS TOYOTA AUSTRALIA DEMONSTRATE THE TECHNICAL AND ECONOMIC FEASIBILITY OF MANUFACTURING HYDROGE"}